AGENTS.md: "Testing and linting", "Common tasks", "Deployment", "Infrastructure", "Environment" — commands, toolchain, ops (pyproject.toml, uv.lock, package*.json, .pre-commit-config.yaml, infra/, scripts/, .env.test)
AGENTS.md: "Skills", "Code Exploration Policy", "Detail Docs" — agent-context plumbing and the doc index (.claude/, .skills/, skills/, .gitmodules, CLAUDE.md, a doc added or renamed)
README.md: "Features", "Endpoints", "Authentication", "Project Structure" — request/response examples, open routes, CORS claim, module tree (models.py, auth.py, main.py, routers/, services/, middleware/, usps_data/, canada_post_data/, alembic/)
CHANGELOG.md: "[Unreleased]" — user-visible API changes (models.py, routers/, core/warnings.py, core/validation_status.py)

